On close inspection, I find that the ascension run is not *meaningfully*
harder between XL14 and XL30.

In practice, any character with a reasonable XL (i.e.  14+) will be of
high enough level to meet basically anything, since once you're on your
way out with the trinket, the DL factor is always the depth of Moloch's
Sanctum, which will be something on the order of 45-50, giving an XL 14
character a mongen difficulty of 29-32.  An XL 30 character will face a
mongen difficulty of 37-40.

The most powerful randomly generable monsters are arch-liches
(difficulty 29) and Archons (difficulty 26).

A few popcorn monsters will be made ineligible, I guess.

